{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"p6e_5xg_v64","canonical_person_id":"p6e_5xg_v64","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["p6e_5xg_v64"],"persons":[{"id":"p6e_5xg_v64","label":"仇勃","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"仇勃","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong","quote":"仇勃"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"仇勃，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-066-liuhong-ws1527632","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-066-liuhong-ws1527632"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003:m0358","surface":"仇勃","start":358,"end":360,"person_id":"p6e_5xg_v64","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p003","text":"時荊部守宰多闕，弘請補選，帝從之。弘乃敘功銓德，隨才補授，甚為論者所稱。乃表曰：「被中詔，敕臣隨資品選，補諸缺吏。夫慶賞刑威，非臣所專，且知人則哲，聖帝所難，非臣暗蔽所能斟酌。然萬事有機，豪厘宜慎，謹奉詔書，差所應用。蓋崇化莫若貴德，則所以濟屯，故太上立德，其次立功也。頃者多難，淳樸彌凋，臣輒以征士伍朝補零陵太守，庶以懲波蕩之弊，養退讓之操。臣以不武，前退于宛，長史陶侃、參軍蒯恆、牙門皮初，戮力致討，蕩滅奸凶，侃恆各以始終軍事，初為都戰帥，忠勇冠軍，漢沔清肅，實初等之勳也。《司馬法》'賞不逾時'，欲人知為善之速福也。若不超報，無以勸徇功之士，慰熊羆之志。臣以初補襄陽太守，侃為府行司馬，使典論功事，恆為山都令。詔惟令臣以散補空缺，然沶鄉令虞潭忠誠烈正，首唱義舉，舉善以教，不能者勸，臣輒特轉潭補醴陵令。南郡廉吏仇勃，母老疾困，賊至守衛不移，以致拷掠，幾至隕命。尚書令史郭貞，張昌以為尚書郎，欲訪以朝議，遁逃不出，昌質其妻子，避之彌遠。勃孝篤著於臨危，貞忠厲於強暴，雖各四品，皆可以訓獎臣子，長益風教。臣輒以勃為歸鄉令，貞為信陵令。皆功行相參，循名校實，條列行狀，公文具上。」朝廷以初雖有功，襄陽又是名郡，名器宜慎，不可授初，乃以前東平太守夏侯陟為襄陽太守，余並從之。陟，弘之婿也。弘下教曰：「夫統天下者，宜與天下一心；化一國者，宜與一國為任。若必姻親然後可用，則荊州十郡，安得十女婿然後為政哉！」乃表「陟姻親，舊制不得相監。皮初之勳宜見酬報。」詔聽之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":14,"last_line":14,"raw_start":848,"raw_end":1483,"raw_character_offsets":[850,851,852,853,854,855,856,857,858,859,860,861,862,863,864,865,866,867,868,869,870,871,872,873,874,875,876,877,878,879,880,881,882,883,884,885,886,887,888,889,890,891,892,893,894,895,896,897,898,899,900,901,902,903,904,905,906,907,908,909,910,911,912,913,914,915,916,917,918,919,920,921,922,923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942,943,944,945,946,947,948,949,950,951,952,953,954,955,956,957,958,959,960,961,962,963,964,965,966,967,968,969,970,971,972,973,974,975,976,977,978,979,980,981,982,983,984,985,986,987,988,989,990,991,992,993,994,995,996,997,998,999,1000,1001,1002,1003,1004,1005,1006,1007,1008,1009,1010,1011,1012,1